msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 360.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases both <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Black Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>White Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 2"
