msgid "Deals unaspected damage over time to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 140<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Impact Imminent</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
