msgid "Creates a barrier around self or target party member that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 400 potency.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Play III</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>The Spire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
